      "description": "Initial Draft United Kingdom pilot profile for v0.5-beta, with a pinned control catalog, clarified applicability facts, mapping-source boundaries, resource safeguards, ESAF-1500 evidence types and quality semantics, normalized conditional overlays and evidence expectations using exact factual triggers, and an internet-reachable API condition."
    }
  ]
